---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="AI-Powered Marketing Execution"
  description="Full-service marketing done for you. Discovery, planning, campaigns, lead tracking, and weekly reporting — run by ZeisWorks for small businesses that need results, not slide decks."
  ogTitle="AI-Powered Marketing Execution — zeisWorks"
  ogDescription="ZeisWorks handles the discovery, the 12-month plan, the campaigns, and the reporting. You handle your business."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 space-y-16">

    <!-- Header -->
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-orange uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Marketing · AI-powered</p>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl font-semibold text-ink leading-tight">
        Full-service marketing.<br class="hidden sm:block" /> Done for you.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-ink-mid text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
        We handle the discovery, the 12-month plan, the campaigns, the lead tracking, and the weekly reports. You handle your business.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="{{GROWBOTIK_ENGINE_URL}}"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="bg-navy text-cream text-sm px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-navy/90 transition-colors font-medium"
        >
          Run your free 5-minute marketing analysis
        </a>
        <a
          href="/#contact"
          class="border border-navy text-navy text-sm px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-navy/5 transition-colors font-medium"
        >
          Talk through your situation →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Problem -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-4">Most marketing doesn't work. Here's why.</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-ink-mid leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Traditional marketing agencies charge a retainer and deliver a slide deck. You get a strategy document, a few campaign tweaks, and a monthly call where someone reads you numbers you could have read yourself. The campaigns either run on autopilot or require constant supervision from you.
        </p>
        <p>
          The other path — doing it yourself — works until it doesn't. You can manage Google Ads or post on social media, but the moment your business gets busy, the marketing stops. Leads dry up. You get busy again, scramble on the marketing, and repeat the cycle.
        </p>
        <p>
          What actually moves the needle is execution that happens consistently, tracks every lead back to its source, and improves over time — without requiring your attention to keep running.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How it works -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-6">How it works</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        {[
          {
            num: '01',
            name: 'Marketing gap analysis',
            body: 'We start with a fast, AI-powered discovery session to understand your business, your goals, and the gap between where you are and where you want to be. We come back with a plain-English assessment: what\'s working, what\'s missing, and what the ROI looks like if we fix it. This takes about 5 minutes of your time and costs nothing.',
          },
          {
            num: '02',
            name: '12-month growth roadmap',
            body: 'From the gap analysis, we build a customized 12-month plan — specific campaigns, specific channels, specific targets. Not a template. A plan built for your business, your location, and your market. You review it, approve it, and we execute it.',
          },
          {
            num: '03',
            name: 'Done-for-you execution',
            body: 'ZeisWorks runs the campaigns. Every lead is tracked back to its source — organic, ads, your Google Business Profile, your website. Calls are recorded and transcribed. A plain-English performance report lands in your inbox every Monday. The system keeps learning and improving without your intervention.',
          },
        ].map(step => (
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-cream-dark bg-cream p-6">
            <p class="text-xs text-orange font-medium uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">{step.num}</p>
            <h3 class="font-serif font-semibold text-ink text-lg mb-2">{step.name}</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink-mid leading-relaxed">{step.body}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- What's included -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-6">What's included</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-4">
        {[
          { title: 'AI-powered discovery', body: 'A structured analysis of your current marketing, your market, and the gap. Completed in minutes. No long discovery calls, no homework for you.' },
          { title: '12-month growth plan', body: 'A real plan, specific to your business. Channels, campaigns, timelines, and projected outcomes — built to be executed, not presented.' },
          { title: 'Campaign execution', body: 'Google Ads, Meta, local SEO, Google Business Profile — we run the campaigns. Ongoing optimization without you managing it.' },
          { title: 'Lead tracking across every channel', body: 'Every form fill and inbound call traced back to its source. You always know what\'s generating leads and what isn\'t.' },
          { title: 'Call recording and transcription', body: 'All inbound calls recorded, transcribed, and reviewed. After-hours calls are answered and handled — no lead goes to voicemail unanswered.' },
          { title: 'Weekly performance reports', body: 'A plain-English Monday report: what happened, where leads came from, what\'s improving. No jargon, no vanity metrics.' },
          { title: 'Ongoing optimization', body: 'The system monitors performance continuously and adjusts — not just at the monthly check-in. Campaigns improve over time without you having to ask.' },
        ].map(item => (
          <li class="flex gap-4 items-start">
            <span class="mt-1.5 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange shrink-0"></span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-ink font-medium">{item.title}.</strong>{' '}
              <span class="text-ink-mid">{item.body}</span>
            </div>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Who it's for -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-4">Who it's for</h2>
      <p class="text-ink-mid leading-relaxed mb-4">
        This service fits businesses where inbound leads drive revenue and nobody on your team has time to manage marketing consistently. If any of these sound familiar, it's the right fit:
      </p>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        {[
          'You\'re generating leads but don\'t know where they\'re coming from',
          'Your Google Ads are running but you\'ve never looked at what\'s converting',
          'You rely on word-of-mouth because you never had time to set up anything else',
          'You tried an agency and got a report, not results',
          'Your marketing stops when you get busy',
          'You\'re missing calls and losing business after hours',
        ].map(situation => (
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-cream-dark bg-cream p-4 text-sm text-ink-mid">{situation}</div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="mt-4 grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
        {['Home services (HVAC, plumbing, electrical, roofing)', 'Healthcare and dental practices', 'Professional services (law, accounting, insurance)', 'Real estate and property management', 'Trades and contractors'].map(sector => (
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-cream-dark bg-cream p-4 text-sm text-ink-mid">{sector}</div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Pricing note -->
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-cream-dark bg-cream-dark p-8">
      <p class="text-xs text-ink-light uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Pricing</p>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-4">Flat monthly. No hourly rate.</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-4">
        {[
          { label: 'One flat number', body: 'You get a specific monthly price for the specific scope. No hourly clock, no surprises when the invoice arrives.' },
          { label: 'Approved before anything starts', body: 'You see the plan and the price before we do anything. Nothing begins until you say so.' },
          { label: 'Start with the free analysis', body: 'The gap analysis and 5-minute discovery are free. The plan comes back with a price attached. You decide what happens next.' },
        ].map(item => (
          <li class="flex gap-4 items-start">
            <span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange shrink-0"></span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-ink font-medium">{item.label}.</strong>{' '}
              <span class="text-ink-mid text-sm">{item.body}</span>
            </div>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-navy/20 bg-navy/5 p-8">
      <p class="text-xs text-navy uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Start here</p>
      <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2">See what your marketing looks like right now.</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink-mid mb-6 leading-relaxed">
        The free marketing analysis takes 5 minutes and shows you exactly where leads are coming from, what's missing, and what's worth fixing. No commitment. No sales call required to get that far.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="{{GROWBOTIK_ENGINE_URL}}"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-block bg-navy text-cream text-sm px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-navy/90 transition-colors"
        >
          Run the free analysis
        </a>
        <a
          href="/#contact"
          class="inline-block border border-navy text-navy text-sm px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-navy/5 transition-colors"
        >
          Or tell us what you're trying to fix →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Back -->
    <p class="text-sm text-ink-light">
      <a href="/marketing" class="hover:text-ink transition-colors">← Marketing</a>
      &nbsp;·&nbsp;
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-ink transition-colors">Back to home →</a>
    </p>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
